the conversation going at events designed to help you connect with the people building what’s next.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"universe-buttons\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://reg.githubuniverse.com/flow/github/universe26/attendee-portal/page/sessioncatalog?tab.allsessions=1783449560443001ldrh&search.curatedagenda=1756241411926002e1Dm\" class=\"mdBtnR full-width mdBtnR-primary\"><span class=\"mdBtnR-text\">Learn more</span></a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"tile universe-content jumbo\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"uc-time\">Oct. 28-29  <span>|</span> 9 am - 5 pm <span>|</span>  Gateway Pavilion</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>Hack your badge</h5>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.rainfocus.com/github/universe26/static/staticfile/staticfile/explore-hack-your-badge_1756134069041001x35W.jpg\" alt=\"Hack your badge\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"abstract\">Every ticket includes a hackable badge — code it, customize it, and create a one-of-a-kind memento of your Universe experience.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"universe-buttons\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-explore-add='{\"days\": [{\"day\": \"Oct 28\", \"start\": \"8am\", \"end\": \"5pm\"}, {\"day\": \"Oct 29\", \"start\": \"8:30am\", \"end\": \"5pm\"}]}' class=\"mdBtnR mdBtnR-primary\" type=\"button\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"mdBtnR-text\">Add to agenda</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>re\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"tile universe-content jumbo\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"uc-time\">Oct. 28-29  <span>|</span> 9 am - 5 pm <span>|</span>  Gateway Pavilion</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>the-shop</h5>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.rainfocus.com/github/universe26/static/staticfile/staticfile/Session_Image_the_shop_1782427202400001ohnX.jpg\" alt=\"the_shop\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"abstract\">Take a piece of GitHub home with you. From exclusive Universe gear to GitHub Copilot merch, The GitHub Shop is packed with fan-favorite collectibles.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"universe-buttons\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-explore-add='{\"days\": [{\"day\": \"Oct 28\", \"start\": \"8am\", \"end\": \"5pm\"}, {\"day\": \"Oct 29\", \"start\": \"8:30am\", \"end\": \"5pm\"}]}' class=\"mdBtnR mdBtnR-primary\" type=\"button\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"mdBtnR-text\">Add to agenda</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"tile universe-content jumbo\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"uc-time\">Oct. 28-29  <span>|</span> 9 am - 5 pm <span>|</span>  Gateway Pavilion</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5>wellness-lounge</h5>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.rainfocus.com/github/universe26/static/staticfile/staticfile/wellness_lounge_1785346675934001DXZr.png\" alt=\"the_shop\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"abstract\">A new space to take a pause, clear your cache, and return to your Universe experience refreshed.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"universe-buttons\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-explore-add='{\"days\": [{\"day\": \"Oct 28\", \"start\": \"8am\", \"end\": \"5pm\"}, {\"day\": \"Oct 29\", \"start\": \"8:30am\", \"end\": \"5pm\"}]}' class=\"mdBtnR mdBtnR-primary\" type=\"button\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"mdBtnR-text\">Add to agenda</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</article>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"universe-session-info\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<div data-usi-trigger=\"sessiontype\" data-usi-title=\"Session type\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Main stage</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>The highest-production stage at Universe. Main stage sessions feature industry leaders, GitHub customers doing cutting-edge work, and big ideas shaping the future of software development. These are the sessions that set the tone for the event.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Breakout session (40 minutes)</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>A focused presentation from one or two speakers sharing expertise, insights, and practical takeaways. Q&A and brief audience interaction are encouraged.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Workshop (90 minutes)</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>An immersive, interactive session focused entirely on practical learning. Facilitators guide attendees through targeted exercises step by step — no demo portion, just depth. Participants leave with skills they can put to work immediately. Note: workshops require an additional fee of $99, which you can add to your registration in the <a href=\"https://reg.githubuniverse.com/flow/github/universe26/attendee-portal/page/home\">Attendee Portal</a></span>.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Sandbox session (45 mins)</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>An interactive session that blends demo and workshop. Facilitators walk through how they solved a real challenge, then attendees work through a similar exercise on provided lab machines. Due to the interactive nature and popularity of this format, signups are limited to one sandbox session per person.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Ship & Tell (15 minutes)</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>Built something worth sharing? Ship & Tell is a short, builder-to-builder format for developers who want to show what they made, why it matters, and what they learned along the way. \r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Product demo (15 minutes)</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>A focused look at tips, tricks, and best practices for getting more out of a specific product.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Panel discussion (40 minutes)</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>A moderated conversation with a diverse group of experts on timely topics shaping the industry. Panels should surface a range of perspectives, challenge conventional thinking, and spark new ideas. Expect significant time for Q&A and audience engagement.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Fireside chat (40 minutes)</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>A one-on-one conversation between a moderator and a single speaker. Think panel discussion, but more intimate.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Discussions lounge</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>Peer-to-peer conversations powered by Braindate. Propose a topic or browse what others want to discuss, then connect 1:1 or in small groups of up to six. No slides, no stage — just focused conversation with people who care about the same things you do.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Session after party</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>Informal Q&A with main stage speakers, held in GitHub Central shortly after their session ends. A chance to go deeper, ask the questions you didn't get to, and connect directly with the people on stage. \r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\r\n\t<div data-usi-trigger=\"level\" data-usi-title=\"Level\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Level 100 – Introductory</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>Designed for those new to the topic. These sessions cover foundational concepts, features, and benefits — no prior expertise assumed.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Level 200 – Intermediate</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>Best suited for attendees with a working understanding of the topic. These sessions explore real-world applications, technical details, and best practices.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Level 300 – Advanced</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>Intended for experienced practitioners. These sessions dive into complex, real-world challenges, advanced techniques, and expert-level insights.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\r\n\t<div data-usi-trigger=\"deliveryformat\" data-usi-title=\"Delivery format\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>In-person</h4>\r\n\t\t<p>Join us live at Universe for the full interactive experience with speakers and fellow attendees.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t<h4>Livestream</h4> \r\n\t\t<p>Watch live from anywhere, then access the recording later. Get the real-time experience remotely.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>Recorded</h4> \r\n\t\t<p>Catch this session on-demand after the event — perfect for revisiting key insights or sharing with your team.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>On-demand</h4> \r\n\t\t<p>Available to watch anytime after Universe. Dive in when it fits your schedule.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h4>AI summary</h4> \r\n\t\t<p>Get instant key takeaways with an AI-generated summary available shortly after the session ends.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n"
        }
       }
      }
     ]
